                "description": "The Sion Lever with Rectangular Rose is a modern leverset great for your home remodel. It will fit most pre-drilled doors up to 3 inches thick. This Sion Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from some of the most popular finish colors in today's design trends.",
